# Gitignored files a fresh worktree needs, copied from the main checkout.
# .gitignore syntax. Claude Code applies this to worktrees it creates;
# `bin/xms-task` applies it to script-created worktrees under .tasks/.
#
# NOTE: .venv/ is deliberately NOT listed. It contains absolute paths and an
# editable install pointing at the source tree it was built in, so a copied
# venv would silently import the WRONG worktree's xmsconan. It is rebuilt by
# scripts/provision_claude_worktree.sh instead.

.envrc
.env
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json
